### Hierarchy Conventions

- Step 1 above names the levels this database has
- Every level is a choice among named options; select by name match
- When the user specifies a location, select it at the level of that kind of place
- `build_channels` returns the address each selected leaf holds; an address is
  never assembled from the levels
